'' A 'test' block in a module file: its declarations are the body's, so the interface holds F and
'' G and nothing of the test (the block's tokens are recorded as one range, tkiemit skips it).
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.ttb/cache
'' CLEAN: build/.ttb
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 --emit-tki tests/modules/src/testblock/m
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: public declare function F( ) as long
'' EXPECT-OUT: public declare function G( ) as long
'' EXPECT-NOT: localX
'' EXPECT-NOT: LOCALC
'' EXPECT-NOT: __tko_test_
